  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You reshape the dragonmark to make it look like another true dragonmark or even mask its presence. This spell physically alters your dragonmark's appearance to either hide it on your skin or look like a different mark of equal or lesser power to a quick inspection. If you modify it to appear as another dragonmark, you do not gain any of the abilities of the other mark.<br />If you use any dragonmark focus spell with the Aberrant Feedback trait, this spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> the duration increases by 5 minutes</p>"
    },
